      "Owning product vision and backlog for a global gaming company — translating stakeholder needs into user stories, running agile ceremonies, and validating delivery against acceptance criteria.",
    tags: ["Product Ownership", "Agile", "Gaming"],
  },
  {
    title: "IT Manager — Vodafone / Aricent",
    period: "Dec 2012 – Jun 2016",
    description:
      "Managed a team of 7 and 320+ telecom connections across internal Vodafone UK projects — from ICT budget planning and vendor negotiation to network security and crisis management.",
    tags: ["IT Management", "Team Leadership", "Telecom"],
  },
  {
    title: "Senior System Engineer — Vodafone / Aricent",
    period: "Jul 2011 – Dec 2012",
    description:
      "Delivered VoIP and network infrastructure across UK, France, and Denmark branches, supporting 300+ end users alongside hardware procurement and top-management SLA support.",
    tags: ["Infrastructure", "VoIP", "Multi-region"],
  },
  {
